ypeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Workshop%20Quarter\">Workshop Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Factory\">Glooth Factory</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Underground%20Glooth%20Factory\">Underground Glooth Factory</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Abandoned%20Sewers\">Abandoned Sewers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond%20Dungeon\">Oramond Dungeon</a> (depending on Magistrate votes), <a href=\"#/wiki/Jaccus%20Maxxen%27s%20Dungeon\">Jaccus Maxxen's Dungeon</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tMetal gargoyles can retarget. This may causes shooters in a team hunt to be cursed or killed.<br/><br/>A metal gargoyle attacks in melee range. A metal gargoyle never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTreat them as dragons. Stand diagonal if possible to avoid damage from the beam. <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\">Life Drain</a> protection is advisable when hunting them alongside <a href=\"#/wiki/Rustheap%20Golem\">Rustheap Golems</a>. They are very slow, so you shouldn't have any problems with keeping distance as a mage or a paladin.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Its experience was decreased from 1400 to 1022 on the first batch of changes of Update 12.31. It was later increased to 1278 on the fifth batch of changes.</li>\n<li>As announced on December 10, 2024, the patch increased its XP from 1,278 to 1,470.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 12,207 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-199</td>\n<td>91.3</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"98.959613\" style=\"text-align:center;\">99%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Coin_c8a106.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>0.60</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"39.805030\" style=\"text-align:center;\">40%\n</td></tr